   "texts": [
    "\"About this wound — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\"",
    "\"Careful with it. And — thank you.\"",
    "\"See you at the fire.\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 1,
   "day": 45,
   "npc": "David",
   "wantId": "ask_favor",
   "file": "/tmp/journey-deep-r6-favor-20202-1.txt",
   "texts": [
    "\"About the food I needed — still need hands. Are you in?  You'd know about that.\"",
    "\"Thank you. I won't forget who fed me when it mattered.\"",
    "\"Don't be a stranger.\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "day": 46,
   "npc": "Guadalupe",
   "wantId": "ask_favor",
   "file": "/tmp/journey-deep-r6-favor-20202-2.txt",
   "texts": [
    "\"Can I tell you something? I saw something in the woods I'm not telling anyone about.\"",
    "\"Good talk.\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "day": 50,
   "npc": "James",
   "wantId": "ask_favor",
   "file": "/tmp/journey-deep-r6-favor-20202-3.txt",
   "texts": [
    "\"We never finished talking about their secret — we got cut off, 4 days back.\"",
    "\"Pantry's thin and getting thinner. Will you forage with me tomorrow? Two pairs of eyes, twice the ground.\"",
    "\"Steady as she goes. See you at dinner.\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "day": 58,
   "npc": "James",
   "wantId": "ask_favor",
   "file": "/tmp/journey-deep-r6-favor-20202-4.txt",
   "texts": [
    "\"We never finished talking about their secret — we got cut off, 4 days back. We still owe that question a proper ending, too.\"",
    "\"I can't reach this properly. Will you help me clean it?\"",
    "\"See you at the fire.\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "day": 62,
   "npc": "James",
   "wantId": "ask_favor",
   "file": "/tmp/journey-deep-r6-favor-20202-5.txt",
   "texts": [
    "\"I asked Malik about this wound — Malik's gone. Still need hands. Are you in?\"",
    "\"Good. We've got a plan forming. I can feel it.\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "day": 65,
   "npc": "Sofia",
   "wantId": "ask_favor",
   "file": "/tmp/journey-deep-r6-favor-20202-6.txt",
   "texts": [
    "\"Malik and I never finished talking about that favor — we got cut off, 6 days back. You're wearing Malik's shoes now — want to pick it up? Just my read.\"",
    "\"Okay. One step at a time, right?\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
